# Pairs with MovedStreamKeepsAckedWrites. The flip is guarded by the durable
# fence, but a re-activated source does not derive its fence from it: it comes
# up unfenced and acknowledges a write while the durable fence is still held, so
# the guarded flip still succeeds and discards the write. The guard on the flip
# is not sufficient on its own; the activation must honour the record too.
MODULE: MovedStreamKeepsAckedWritesActivationIgnoresDurableFence
TARGET: MovedStreamKeepsAckedWrites
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a re-activated source ignores the durable fence, so a guarded flip still discards a write it acknowledged
PERTURBS: ShardCrash

--- FIND
    /\ afence' = (dfence /\ ~lapsed)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the new activation ignores the durable fence.
    /\ afence' = FALSE
--- END